    <tag k="artist_name" v="William Cox"/>
    <tag k="artwork_type" v="statue"/>
    <tag k="description" v="Charles Wicksteed's constant companion was his beloved dog Jerry, who was never found after mysteriously disappearing. Ignorance of his fate distressed his master, who commissioned local stonemason William Cox to make a memorial statue which still stands"/>
